Package brightness_pkg
---------------------------------------
Description: The node inside this package determines the average brightness of an image to be able to determine if a light is on or off.

Inputs: 
\image
    Type: sensor_msgs/msg/Image

Outputs:
\light
    Type: std_msgs/msg/Bool

Run:
    ros2 run brightness_pkg brightness

Parameters:
    depth: Sets the que size of the publisher/subscriber, Default = 10
    brightness_threshold: Sets the threshold for the average brightness of the image which determines whether the light is on or off, Default = 100 

Core components:
    avg_brightness(const sensor_msgs::msg::Image::SharedPtr msg): Determines the average brightness of an image and publishes whether the light is on or off